OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 DEC
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GHarpist Claire Jones and tenor Ed
OL,6,     GLyon.
OL,7,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,8,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,9,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,10,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,11,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,12,     Gcelebrates its 90th anniversary
OL,13,     Gwith music by Grieg, Tippett and
OL,14,     GAyanna Witter-Johnson, with the
OL,15,     Ghelp of pianist Sir Stephen Hough.
OL,16,G2200FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,17,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,18,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,19,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,20,     GTonight, the "diva of the diode"
OL,21,     GSuzanne Ciani.
